    {
      "name": "storm_spirit_static_remnant",
      "id": 5098,
      "name_zh": "残影",
      "name_en": "Static Remnant",
      "description_zh": "风暴之灵制造一个充满爆炸性能量的自身残影，会向目标地点走去，持续%abilityduration%秒。如果有人接近就会引爆造成伤害，残影持续%abilityduration%秒。",
      "description_en": "Creates an explosively charged image of Storm Spirit that walks to the target position and lasts for %abilityduration% seconds. Will detonate and deal damage if an enemy unit comes near it.",
      "notes_zh": [
        "残影在技能施放%static_remnant_delay%秒后才能实体化。",
        "残影在持续时间内拥有顺畅视野。",
        "残影爆炸将伤害%static_remnant_damage_radius%码作用范围内的单位，但是触发范围是%static_remnant_radius%码。",
        "可以对自身施放，这样会原地施放。"
      ],
      "notes_en": [
        "Remnants take %static_remnant_delay% second to materialize after the spell is cast.",
        "Remnants grant unobstructed vision for their duration.",
        "The explosion actually hits units in a %static_remnant_damage_radius% radius, but will only be triggered in %static_remnant_radius%.",
        "Can be self-cast to cast in place."
      ],
